{"channelId":"UC09T_cXrnSFu-irWGcfEifg","row":["BESS - British Elbow & Shoulder Society",4330,"BESS's aim is to promote education, research and best practice in upper limb orthopaedics - more specifically the disciplines of shoulder and elbow surgery.\n\nThis channel is to support GP’s (general practitioners) and their patients and provides information and exercise videos for the most common cause of shoulder pain. The videos support a downloadable leaflet (http://www.bess.org.uk/application/files/7215/2723/2910/PublicationA5version-nonbooklet.pdf) \n\nThese booklets and videos have been prepared by BESS surgeons and BESS physiotherapists with the support of the NHS Getting it Right First Time Programme (GIRFT).\n\nWritten and produced in 2018 by Jonathan Rees, Ro Kulkarni, Jo Gibson, Clare Connor. Supported by Matthew Barker and Rachel Yates.","","United Kingdom"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC09T_cXrnSFu-irWGcfEifg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC09T_cXrnSFu-irWGcfEifg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:18:05.160Z","channelId":"UC09T_cXrnSFu-irWGcfEifg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"28d5bf60f7bcd73a4997b02aa7a7cfab31132ebc7a714232fe2bd8353ee3da68","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"575905693e06fa13c530e5f4d8ed36ae9e4dafe22f37d9681169d6ce58a19148"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC09T_cXrnSFu-irWGcfEifg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:18:05.160Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC09T_cXrnSFu-irWGcfEifg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":4330,"raw":"4.33K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC09T_cXrnSFu-irWGcfEifg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:18:05.160Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"physical therapist","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flag